# Temporary files
# Every throwaway file — one-off node scripts, scratch data, and verification
# specs — is named tmp-*. Probe specs are tmp-<name>.probe.spec.ts: still ending
# in .spec.ts so Playwright's default testMatch discovers and runs them, but
# never auto-committed. (*.tmp covers the suffix form; tmp-* the prefix form.)
tmp-*
*.tmp
test.ics
test-parser.js
data-backup.zip
.direnv/*
